<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard near-term raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard near-term raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Engelhard Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it kept Engelhard's long-term rating as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
